-- 32x32 maze, 3-bit color codes (see cell_color_decoder in visualization.v)
-- 000 wall, 001 open, 010 start, 011 goal, 100 visited, 101 current, 110 path
-- address = y*32 + x; start = (1, 1), goal = (29, 29) as (x, y)
-- addresses 1024..12287 are unused and filled with wall
